  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>empirical-bayes-rates-partials-a · 4×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1024 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-empirical-bayes-rates-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-empirical-bayes-rates-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const eventsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; events: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const populationsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; populations: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const partialsAOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; partialsA: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const ROWS: u32 = 791u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const LANES: u32 = 256u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const GROUPS: u32 = 4u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">fn isFiniteFloat(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">// A runtime operand keeps the quiet-NaN bit pattern out of constant evaluation.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">fn getQuietNaN(seed: u32) -&gt; f32 { return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (seed &amp; 0u)); }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">// Two-sided normal p-value erfc(|z| / sqrt(2)) with the Numerical Recipes erfcc Chebyshev fit\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">// (fractional error below 1.2e-7 in exact arithmetic), so tiny p-values keep relative accuracy.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">fn getTwoSidedPValue(z: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  let x = abs(z) * 0.70710678118654752;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  let t = 1.0 / (1.0 + 0.5 * x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  let exponent = -x * x - 1.26551223 + t * (1.00002368 + t * (0.37409196 + t * (0.09678418 +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">    t * (-0.18628806 + t * (0.27886807 + t * (-1.13520398 + t * (1.48851587 +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">    t * (-0.82215223 + t * 0.17087277))))))));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  return min(t * exp(exponent), 1.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; scratch: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">// Fixed-order tree sum of one value per lane. Every lane of the workgroup must call it together.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">fn reduceSum(value: f32, lane: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  scratch[lane] = value;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  for (var stride = LANES / 2u; stride &gt; 0u; stride = stride / 2u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">    if (lane &lt; stride) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">      scratch[lane] += scratch[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  return scratch[0];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"50\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"51\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">  _ = &amp;events;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  _ = &amp;populations;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  _ = &amp;partialsA;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  let lane = localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  let group = (index - lane) / LANES;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  var e = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  var b = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  var included = false;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  if (index &lt; ROWS) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">    e = events[eventsOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">    b = populations[populationsOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">    included = isFiniteFloat(e) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(b) &amp;&amp; b &gt; 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  let count = reduceSum(select(0.0, 1.0, included), lane);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  let eventSum = reduceSum(select(0.0, e, included), lane);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  let populationSum = reduceSum(select(0.0, b, included), lane);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  if (lane == 0u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">    partialsA[partialsAOffset + group] = count;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">    partialsA[partialsAOffset + GROUPS + group] = eventSum;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">    partialsA[partialsAOffset + 2u * GROUPS + group] = populationSum;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>events<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"events\">events</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>populations<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"populations\">populations</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>partialsA<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"empirical-bayes-rates-partials-a\">empirical-bayes-rates-partials-a</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUEmpiricalBayesRates/partials-a · main · c26592e9</figcaption></figure></section>",
